OL,3,GNEWSANew rule can remove Andrew's
OL,4,AFreedom of City
OL,5,
OL,6,FA process that could strip Andrew
OL,7,FMountbatten-Windsor of his Freedom of
OL,8,Fthe City of London has been approved,
OL,9,Fwith a decision on this to be made as a
OL,10,F"matter of urgency".
OL,12,FThe City of London Corporation (CLC)
OL,13,Fsaid the organisation's main
OL,14,Fdecision-making body, the court of
OL,15,Fcommon council, approved the measure -
OL,16,Fallowing the honour to be removed from
OL,17,Findividuals - on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
