OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew rule can remove Andrew's
OL,4,AFreedom of City
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolicy chairman, Chris Hayward, said it
OL,7,Fensured future decisions were taken
OL,8,Ffairly, transparently, and in
OL,9,Faccordance with the law, with
OL,10,Fappropriate safeguards in place for all
OL,11,Fparties involved.
OL,13,FThe process will be considered for the
OL,14,Fdisgraced former prince, who was
OL,15,Fcriticised for failing to surrender his
OL,16,Fhonour.
